  "body": "## What changed\n\nShow the app icon at the start of all 44 operation sections.\nShow control and browser icons beside their guide names.\nPublish 93 matching app PNGs and link their complete licence notice.\nAdd one reusable icon component and dark-mode styling.\n\nThe release workflow pins Zola 0.23.6, which removed shortcodes.\nUse its native component syntax: `{{ <icon name=\"op-face\" /> }}`.\nThe component lives in `site/templates/shortcodes/icon.html`.\nSee the [Zola content documentation](https://www.getzola.org/documentation/content/overview/).\n\n## Cause\n\nThe guide named operations and controls without showing their app icons.\nReaders could not match the guide names to the app buttons.\nNo site test checked icon names or asset parity.\n\n## Tests\n\nThe pins failed on unchanged upstream `31f8d03d7` before the fix.\nThe final pins pass:\n\n- `GuideIcons.test_component_static_icons_and_license_match_app`\n- `GuideIcons.test_operation_sections_and_guide_components_match_app`\n- `GuideIcons.test_zola_build_renders_all_icons_and_notice_under_prefix`\n\nAll eight mutations failed, then passed after restoration:\n\n- Rename an app icon in the source table.\n- Corrupt a copied PNG.\n- Change the copied licence text.\n- Restore the upstream 2D operation page.\n- Restore the upstream footer.\n- Restore the upstream stylesheet.\n- Remove the icon component.\n- Remove the inline Generate icons.\n\n`python3 -m unittest discover -s site/tests -v`: 19 passed.\n`zola build --output-dir /tmp/1901-built-site`: passed with Zola 0.23.6.\nThe build produced 43 pages and 10 sections.\nThe rendered icon test also checks a deployment path prefix.\n`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: passed; the documentation-only plan selected zero Rust steps.\nClippy does not apply because no crate changed.\nEach diff hunk has a written justification outside the branch.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone.\nThe `.nc` and `.cl` diff is empty.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nNo browser visual inspection or Windows build.\nNo Rust suite was selected for this site-only change.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nPR #1921 touches the EDM guide page in different prose lines.\nIt does not change the operation picture lines used here.\nPR #2046 changes the hero CSS selectors.\nThis PR adds the separate `img.ui-icon` selector.\nEach touches the same file, different function; whichever merges second refreshes.\nNeither requires a stack.\n\nEffort: medium.\n\nChangelog: none\n\nFixes #1901\n",
